{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19011","headline":"和令狐相公以司空裴相见招南亭看雪四韵 · 刘禹锡","name":"和令狐相公以司空裴相见招南亭看雪四韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重门不下关，枢务有余闲。\n上客同看雪，高亭尽见山。\n瑞呈霄汉外，兴入笑言间。\n知是平阳会，人人带酒还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19011.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19011","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}